"polo que se ignorarán."

#: ui/dialogaskcreateaclprefs.cpp:32
#, kde-format
msgid "New Secret Collection Access Policy"
msgstr "Nova política de acceso a coleccións de segredos"

#: ui/dialogaskcreateaclprefs.cpp:50
#, kde-format
msgid "You just created a secret collection named '%1'."
msgstr "Creou unha colección de segredos chamada «%1»."

#: ui/dialogaskcreateaclprefs.cpp:56
#, kde-format
msgid "You used '%1' application to create this secret collection."
msgstr "Creouna co aplicativo «%1»."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, m_explainCollectionLabel)
#: ui/dialogaskcreateaclprefs.ui:23
#, no-c-format, kde-format
msgid "You just created a KSecretService collection named '%1'."
msgstr "Creou unha colección de KSecretService chamada «%1»."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, m_explainApplicationLabel)
#: ui/dialogaskcreateaclprefs.ui:39
#, no-c-format, kde-format
msgid "You used '%1' application to create this collection."
msgstr "Creouna co aplicativo «%1»."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, m_explainQuestionLabel)
#: ui/dialogaskcreateaclprefs.ui:49
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"What do you expect KSecretService to do each time this application accesses "
"this collection?"
msgstr ""
"Que quere que faga KSecretService cando este aplicativo acceda a esta "
"colección?"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, m_permissionAllowRadio)
#: ui/dialogaskcreateaclprefs.ui:72 ui/dialogaskunlockaclprefs.ui:56
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Always allow access to this application\n"
"without asking for the password"
msgstr ""
"Permitirlle sempre acceso a este aplicativo\n"
"sen pedir o contrasinal."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, m_permissionAskRadio)
#: ui/dialogaskcreateaclprefs.ui:83 ui/dialogaskunlockaclprefs.ui:67
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Ask for the password each time\n"
"the application opens this collection"
msgstr ""
"Pedir o contrasinal cada vez\n"
"que o aplicativo abra esta colección."

#: ui/dialogaskunlockaclprefs.cpp:33
#, kde-format
msgid "Unlock Collection Access Policy"
msgstr "Desbloquear a política de acceso á colección"

#: ui/dialogaskunlockaclprefs.cpp:54
#, kde-format
msgid "The application '%1' asked to open the secret collection named '%2'."
msgstr "O aplicativo «%1» solicitou abrir a colección de segredos «%2»."

#: ui/dialogaskunlockaclprefs.cpp:66
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This collection was created by the application '%1'. What should "
"KSecretsService do now?"
msgstr ""
"A colección creouna o aplicativo «%1». Que quere que faga KSecretsService?"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, m_explainCollectionLabel)
#: ui/dialogaskunlockaclprefs.ui:23
#, no-c-format, kde-format
msgid ""
"The application '%1' asked to open the KSecretService collection named '%2'."
msgstr "O aplicativo «%1» solicitou abrir a colección de KSecretService «%2»."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, m_explainApplicationLabel)
#: ui/dialogaskunlockaclprefs.ui:33
#, no-c-format, kde-format
msgid ""
"This collection was created by the application '%1'. What should "
"KSecretService do now?"
msgstr ""
"A colección creouna o aplicativo «%1». Que quere que faga KSecretService?"

#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox)
#: ui/dialogaskunlockaclprefs.ui:49
#, kde-format
msgid "Choose application access policy"
msgstr "Escoller unha política de acceso do aplicativo"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QRadioButton, m_permissionDenyRadio)
#: ui/dialogaskunlockaclprefs.ui:74
#, kde-format
msgid "Deny access to this application"
msgstr "Denegalle a este aplicativo o acceso"

